.SH "نام (NAME)"
timew-show \- display configuration
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
\fBtimew show\fP
.fi
.br
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Displays the effective configuration in hierarchical form.
